# 750 MB of quantized weights and norms. Regenerate with
#   python software/calibrate_all.py && python software/embed_lm_head.py
# The JSON artifacts and index.json ARE tracked - they are ~1.3 MB and
# carry every scale, so the binaries are reproducible from them plus the
# model. Pattern is by EXTENSION, not by suffix: an earlier
# "*_int8.npy" rule silently missed embed_lm_head_int8_per_tensor.npy
# and would have staged 311 MB.
software/out/calib28/*.npy
software/out/calib28/*.npz

